<title>FRANCE: RCI sets 2 bln Ffr 2000 FRN, PIBOR plus 5 bp.</title>
<headline>RCI sets 2 bln Ffr 2000 FRN, PIBOR plus 5 bp.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the lead manager.</p>
<p>BORROWER - RENAULT CREDIT INTERNATIONAL</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - CREDIT COMMERCIAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT   2 BLN FRF	  COUPON  PIBOR +5BP   MATURITY 30.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE  FRN		  ISS PRICE  99.98     PAY DATE 30.JUN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	     REOFFER    99.98     ACCRUAL  30.JUN.97</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A2	    PAY FREQ   QTRLY     FULL FEES  15 BP</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
